#: ../../../how-to/accessibility/turn-on-bounce-keys.md:0
msgid ""
"Turn on bounce keys to ignore rapidly repeated key presses, for example if "
"hand tremors cause you to press a key twice."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/accessibility/turn-on-bounce-keys.md:7
msgid "Topics: Accessibility"
msgstr "話題：無障礙功能"

#: ../../../how-to/accessibility/turn-on-bounce-keys.md:11
msgid "Turn on bounce keys"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/accessibility/turn-on-bounce-keys.md:13
msgid ""
"Turn on *bounce keys* to ignore key presses that are rapidly repeated. For "
"example, if you have hand tremors which cause you to press a key multiple "
"times when you only want to press it once, you should turn on bounce keys."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/accessibility/turn-on-bounce-keys.md:15
msgid "Open the Activities overview and start typing **accessibility**."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/accessibility/turn-on-bounce-keys.md:16
msgid "Click {guilabel}`Accessibility` to open the panel."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/accessibility/turn-on-bounce-keys.md:17
msgid "Open the {guilabel}`Typing` section."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/accessibility/turn-on-bounce-keys.md:18
msgid ""
"In the {guilabel}`Typing Assist` section, enable the {guilabel}`Bounce Keys` "
"option."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/accessibility/turn-on-bounce-keys.md:21
msgid ""
"You can turn bounce keys on and off by clicking the {ref}`accessibility icon "
"<find-the-accessibility-menu>` on the top bar and selecting {guilabel}"
"`Bounce Keys`. The accessibility icon is visible when one or more settings "
"have been enabled from the {guilabel}`Accessibility` panel."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/accessibility/turn-on-bounce-keys.md:24
msgid ""
"Use the {guilabel}`Acceptance` delay slider to change how long bounce keys "
"waits before it registers another key press after you pressed the key for "
"the first time. Select {guilabel}`Beep when a key is rejected` if you want "
"the computer to make a sound each time it ignores a key press because it "
"happened too soon after the previous key press."
msgstr ""
